OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Talk to your loved ones about
OL,4,Aorgan donation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Surrey who suffered a
OL,7,Fcardiac arrest aged just 12 is urging
OL,8,Fpeople to realise the importance of
OL,9,Fregistering as an organ donor.
OL,11,FNow 21, Soban Saqib is currently
OL,12,Fawaiting a potentially life-saving
OL,13,Ftransplant having been told his
OL,14,Finherited genetic condition has left
OL,15,Fhim with end-stage heart failure.
OL,17,FMore than 700 potential donations did
OL,18,Fnot go ahead between April 2021 and
OL,19,FMarch 2026 because families did not
OL,20,Fknow their loved ones' wishes,
OL,21,Faccording to NHS Blood and Transplant
OL,22,F(NHSBT).
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
