OL,3,GNEWSA'Talk to your loved ones about
OL,4,Aorgan donation'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The thing about organ donation is that
OL,7,Fpeople don't think about it until it
OL,8,Fimpacts them and their relatives," said
OL,9,FSaqib.
